# backpost.obj - a dev-sandbox test model for the M3 per-band slices (docs/possible_3d_work.md items 6 + 7).
# A post (0.9 high) on the BACK quarter of its tile (x, z in 0.05 .. 0.45): behind the feet of a unit standing there.
# Hand-written for this repo (no game data). The loader (fw_mesh_rules.c) negates OBJ z into the game's left-handed
# axes, so the file says z -0.45..-0.05 for game z 0.05..0.45 (OBSERVED: "bounds x 0.05..0.45 h 0.00..0.90 z -0.45..-0.05"
# when the file said +z); origin at the anchor tile centre.
# The crate.obj topology: 8 corners, 6 face normals, 12 triangles.
o backpost
v 0.05 0 -0.45
v 0.45 0 -0.45
v 0.45 0 -0.05
v 0.05 0 -0.05
v 0.05 0.9 -0.45
v 0.45 0.9 -0.45
v 0.45 0.9 -0.05
v 0.05 0.9 -0.05
vt 0 0
vt 1 0
vt 1 1
vt 0 1
vn  0 -1  0
vn  0  1  0
vn  0  0 -1
vn  0  0  1
vn -1  0  0
vn  1  0  0
f 1/1/1 2/2/1 3/3/1
f 1/1/1 3/3/1 4/4/1
f 5/1/2 8/4/2 7/3/2
f 5/1/2 7/3/2 6/2/2
f 1/1/3 5/4/3 6/3/3
f 1/1/3 6/3/3 2/2/3
f 4/1/4 3/2/4 7/3/4
f 4/1/4 7/3/4 8/4/4
f 1/1/5 4/2/5 8/3/5
f 1/1/5 8/3/5 5/4/5
f 2/1/6 6/4/6 7/3/6
f 2/1/6 7/3/6 3/2/6
